# Runtime Data Directory
#
# This directory is auto-created at startup and stores:
#   - comicpedia.db   SQLite database (tasks, characters, series, config)
#   - images/         Generated comic panel images
#
# It is excluded from version control (.gitignore).
# If you see stale data after a fresh clone, run:
#
#   pnpm clean
#
# This will delete the entire data/ directory. A fresh database
# will be created automatically on the next startup.
